  total_videos \u003d len(fcpxml_files)\n    processed_count \u003d 0\n    \n    for fcpxml_path in fcpxml_files:\n        base_name \u003d os.path.splitext(os.path.basename(fcpxml_path))[0]\n        # Giả định tên file raw/edited tương ứng\n        raw_video_path \u003d os.path.join(source_dir, f\"{base_name}_raw.mp4\") # Cần chuẩn hóa tên file\n        edited_video_path \u003d os.path.join(source_dir, f\"{base_name}_edited.mp4\") # Cần chuẩn hóa tên file\n\n        if not os.path.exists(raw_video_path) or not os.path.exists(edited_video_path):\n            logging.warning(f\"Missing raw or edited video for {base_name}. Skipping.\")\n            continue\n            \n        success \u003d process_single_video(raw_video_path, edited_video_path, fcpxml_path, workspace_dir)\n        if success:\n            processed_count +\u003d 1\n            \n    logging.info(f\"\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d PIPELINE FINISHED: Processed {processed_count}/{total_videos} videos. \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\")\n\nif __name__ \u003d\u003d \u0027__main__\u0027:\n    # Phần này chỉ để chạy test cục bộ, không dùng trong Colab\n    # load_dotenv()\n    # test_source_dir \u003d os.getenv(\"SOURCE_DATA_DIR\")\n    # main_pipeline(test_source_dir)\n    pass\n```\n\n**Bây giờ, đây là nội dung Ô 4 mới trong Colab:**\n\n```python\n# Ô 4: RUN CORE ANALYSIS PIPELINE\n# ---------------------------------\n# @title ⬅️ Step 3: Run Core Analysis Pipeline (Video -\u003e Chunks)\n# @markdown This cell executes the main processing pipeline. It will find all videos in your source directory, run analysis, and create thousands of small audio/video chunk files in the Colab temporary storage.\n# @markdown ---\n# @markdown **⚠️ This is the most time-consuming step. Please be patient.**\n\nfrom main import main_pipeline\nimport os\n\nprint(\"🏭 Starting the main analysis pipeline...\")\nprint(\"This will process all videos found in your specified batch folder.\")\n\n# Ensure the workspace directory exist